recommend keep-going the core stereo dynamics quartet is whole; the next crux is the ENVELOPE-following dynamics carried to stereo — ALES52's envelope follower (stereo_follow), which adds a per-channel carried envelope memory atop the linked detector, opening the attack/release stereo dynamics (ALES53-62) — agent-doable, no gate reached, witness GREEN, TAME clean.
